000005         IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000006         PROGRAM-ID. FATRESUM.
000007
000008         ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000009         INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000010         FILE-CONTROL.
000011             SELECT ARQ-DIVERG  ASSIGN TO DIVIN *> vou chamar o ARQ-DIVERG
000012                    FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-ENTRADA.
000013
000014         DATA DIVISION.
000015         FILE SECTION.
000016         FD  ARQ-DIVERG *> oq esta a seguir dita as regras do resto
